{
  "_doc": "Query list for scripts/grow-real-papers/main.ts. quotas: papers per field, a TOTAL over every entry of venue-manifest.json that carries the field (raise it to grow the set). Each slot is one venue edition: field, series, year, cap (allocation in round 0; later rounds raise it by 1 per round, round-robin, up to hardCap), queries (exact arXiv API search_query strings, tried in order, results concatenated, rank = position in that concatenation), max_results (page size; up to maxPages pages per query are read when a slot is not yet full), venue (regex source that must match the comment next to the edition year), classSpec (key in CLASS_SPECS of scripts/grow-real-papers/rules.ts), allowPoster (a poster is a presentation format of a full paper there). Slots with source semantic-scholar (fields systems, other) take their candidates from the Semantic Scholar bulk venue listing (s2Query; entries with an ArXiv id, ordered by arXiv id ascending) instead of arXiv comment search; the listing is the acceptance evidence (acceptance: s2-venue-listing), rules 2-4 apply unchanged.",
